        "thought_text": "I apologize for the oversight. The current implementation is indeed counting paths twice for each unique path. To fix this, we should modify our approach to only count paths from one direction and avoid double-counting. This can be achieved by ensuring that we only consider paths where the starting node is always the smaller node number, effectively eliminating the need for bidirectional counting.",
